# This repository formats with Biome (see biome.json), NOT Prettier.
# Prettier is not a dependency here and has no config; a stray Prettier run
# (a global CLI, or an editor's "format on save" extension) reformats files
# away from Biome's canonical style and leaves the tree dirty.
#
# Ignoring everything makes ANY Prettier invocation a safe no-op. Biome does
# not read this file, so `npm run format` / `npm run check` are unaffected.
# To format, use Biome:  npm run format   (check only: npm run check)
**
